preserved by the three numerator generators, as certified in `Checks`.
The 36-bit signatures record adjacency to the fixed letters of b².
The bridge table connects every moved letter to vertex 0 in two steps that
distinguish the two letters in its b²-pair. These are candidate data only;
all properties used by the proof are checked independently in Lean.

Source motivation: GLS3 Table 5.3j. ATLAS permutation attribution is retained in
`LeechRelated/AtlasCarriers/source/`. Reproduce with `source/generate.py`.
